     2939                         in-vatp-parts.road-tax-rubl  * in-vatp-parts.fact-qnty (total)
     2940                         in-vatp-parts.transport-base * in-vatp-parts.fact-qnty (total)
     2941                         in-vatp-parts.transport-rubl * in-vatp-parts.fact-qnty (total)
